---
description: >-
  Classic-look sequence diagram combining central-connection arrows with
  the different participant kinds (`actor`, plain `participant`, and the
  typed `boundary`/`control`/`entity` participants declared via
  `@{"type":...}`), routing a message between each pair.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Alice
  actor Bob
  participant Charlie@{"type":"boundary"}
  participant David@{"type":"control"}
  participant Eve@{"type":"entity"}
  Alice ()->>() Bob: To actor
  Bob ()-->> Charlie: To boundary
  Charlie ()->>() David: To control
  David ()<<-->>() Eve: To entity
  Eve ()-x() Alice: Back to participant
